Not a diagnosis, and not a safety guarantee
-------------------------------------------

The guides in this app are a STARTER SET written to demonstrate the structure: a model, a verdict, steps,
and a reason when the answer is "do not open this". They are not a service manual, they are not specific to
any particular revision of a machine, and they are not a substitute for a qualified technician.

The app does not diagnose a fault it cannot see. A symptom search returns guides, never a cause.

Mains appliances
----------------

Any guide whose verdict is "not a home repair" carries the reason and NO STEPS. That is deliberate: a
microwave stores high voltage after it is unplugged, and a joint in a heat-cycled mains lead is how fires
start. The app will not walk anyone through either.
